{"id":"wx2652806769","title":"这首献词，全文发布！","published_at":"2024-11-11T22:00:00+08:00","published_label":"2024-11-11","cover":"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHaK6EOjxdqOUAkdib0pkHEiaeIKhYIibb7mdW6pBqvm0VOICE3zmcYYYYg/0?wx_fmt=jpeg","summary":"在华南农业大学办学115周年发展大会上 由师生代表共同带来的献词 《大美华农 你我同行》 引起师生校友的广泛共鸣 在此，我们 发布献词全文 与全体华农人 分享这份“农”情与期待 - 大美华农 你我同行 - 天地有大美…","tags":["人物"],"source":"wechat","original_url":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&mid=2652806769&idx=1&sn=7ded90253dc64a4712c35e87709db632","paper_url":null,"word_count":1740,"fetched_at":"2026-11-09T16:47:33+08:00","content_html":"<div><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc9JuUicTWpVBjeicaTwSpcuT22aQOTia5Oy11Eh02vMic5PST128r0EGd4TcNduvIcYcE9558toaf4KYg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><section><span>在华南农业大学办学115周年发展大会上<br/></span></section><section><span>由师生代表共同带来的献词</span></section><section><span>《大美华农  你我同行》</span></section><section><span>引起师生校友的广泛共鸣</span></section><section><span>在此，我们</span><span>发布献词全文</span></section><section><section><span>与全体华农人</span></section><p><span>分享这份“农”情与期待</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><strong>- </strong><strong>大美华农  你我同行</strong><strong> -</strong></span><em></em></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span>天地有大美。</span></p><section><span>大美中有华农的色彩斑斓。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHKzSMpTVLzWz6ibDicicEDwNcRhEk0iaDBhEiaQWK6Psmibn9LLQKTDMibcudQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>数千株宫粉紫荆，</span></p><p><span>汇聚成一片诗意的花海。</span></p><p><span>数百棵中国红樱，</span></p><p><span>在冬日里诉说眷恋。</span></p><p><span>簕杜鹃花开成瀑，</span></p><p><span>映红半个鄱阳湖面。</span></p><p><span>树木园苍翠幽深，</span></p><p><span>能隔断都市的喧嚣。</span></p><p><span>这是大自然的馈赠，</span></p><p><span>也是华农人在用心呵护，</span></p><section><span>年复一年。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH6QpYSK3axv65z2ibBpp8Cbc5ATUjTVYfpoqSGOhyibcNoc2VZGVwggCw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>红墙绿瓦的建筑，</span></p><p><span>在校园中静静矗立。</span></p><p><span>五号楼的宏伟，</span></p><p><span>是时代的丰碑；</span></p><p><span>钟亭的玲珑，</span></p><p><span>如岁月的书签；</span></p><p><span>它们讲述往昔、观照今天，</span></p><section><span>那是描摹民族命运的画卷。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHg5dJ2I2vuYEssaiaIibpFNgFWicqZWRRqq30healfORtSlp27r4kQTR9g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>洪泽湖畔那排高大的柚木，</span></p><p><span>源于周恩来总理带回的种子，</span></p><p><span>曾见证万隆会议的盛况空前。</span></p><p><span>那是友谊之树，</span></p><section><span>在历史长风里奏响命运与共的和弦。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHmEMbT4I0BXTeygJbsfwIRaLJwEFYXr8FniaFTxDOMqT1iafEW1pGlNnA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>这里有无数可爱的生灵。</span></p><p><span>群牛漫步，百鸟翩跹，</span></p><p><span>天鹅悠游，凫鸭戏水，</span></p><section><span>处处妙趣横生，生机盎然。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHvqJJVDrU9rumwuXNMuG0TX6oqiaX4tVicLfojrPXbd7T2HY8gLac0csg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>我们的创校先驱，</span></p><p><span>都是时代俊彦。</span></p><p><span>他们心怀乾坤、格局宏远，</span></p><p><span>他们意志坚定、崇尚实干，</span></p><p><span>他们以使命之光点燃教育救国之梦，</span></p><section><span>他们起步便登临高处、一览群山。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHgv9RKkGt3dZ8pEBwj2edYqmlJvMRMQh5V0xdxwTOSNIZNkffQSI6Lw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>这里涌现了诸多学界泰斗，</span></p><p><span>他们心怀家国，</span></p><p><span>始终以强农兴邦为己任；</span></p><p><span>他们目光如炬，</span></p><p><span>始终对真理执着追求。</span></p><p><span>他们在人类知识边界开疆拓田，</span></p><section><span>为后辈学人树立起光辉典范。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHJd2EIq2bNc4DzibRFA1h7z8QhMqp6g8F9Ybr1dC2B6VCkqiaJ8ibGrevQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>在平凡岗位上的万千师者，</span></p><p><span>让华农这座大厦坚固如磐。</span></p><p><span>如春雨润物无声，</span></p><p><span>与学生相互成就，</span></p><section><span>用心血涵养着这片希望之园。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHD6I2k1ibW7xB8xTEj9mhm4cmjetia6cof1mXWr9hmFr6KXxB2Wpru1lw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>更有三十多万芬芳桃李，</span></p><p><span>从这里完成学业、扬帆起航，</span></p><p><span>成为强国建设、民族复兴的骨干，</span></p><section><span>也为母校的永续发展撑起一片蓝天。</span></section><p><span>“修德 博学 求实 创新”，</span></p><p><span>我们的校训仿若灵动的音符，</span></p><p><span>奏响为人为学的真理乐章，</span></p><section><span>交织成连接历史与未来的桥梁和航线。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH2Qkt4QRPNS8MG800iaF8m6VGeT8BGNCEPFG2hW2HeSjPqQOCDRxtxxg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>“笃学明德、躬行践履”的丁颖精神，</span></p><p><span>彰显着追求至真至善的纯粹，</span></p><p><span>如清泉般润泽我们的灵魂，</span></p><p><span>让我们乐见万物丰盈、内心璀璨。</span></p><p><span>卢永根老校长的一句话：</span></p><p><span>“先党员，后校长；先校长，后教授”，</span></p><p><span>是对教育事业的铮铮誓言，</span></p><p><span>如同高高屹立的灯塔，</span></p><section><span>指引我们对党忠诚、为校奉献。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHBdrbibBvP6iamG3nbUYoovQ3Cn9BHrZ3Y9dzMQq3ZqK2uAnjgrHP9qoQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>前辈铸就的精神，</span></p><p><span>如同永不熄灭的火炬，</span></p><p><span>把前行的路照亮。</span></p><p><span>在华农人身上，</span></p><p><span>常见的是旷达如水，</span></p><p><span>蕴藏的是巍峨似山，</span></p><p><span>脚下是泥土芬芳，</span></p><section><span>征程是星辰大海。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHn09CgibXIx7diacVh7rROHKiaDxcLgCG5nPAwZAicDj51t8MhliaAX0Iq4w/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>越过115年的坐标，</span></p><p><span>我们一起站到了新的起跑线。</span></p><p><span>我们是新时代的华农青年，</span></p><p><span>紧握奋进之笔，</span></p><section><span>谱写着跨越提升、争创一流的诗篇。</span></section><p><span>作为老师，</span></p><p><span>我们心怀感恩、肩扛使命，</span></p><p><span>我们步履坚定、向新而行。</span></p><p><span>作为学生，</span></p><p><span>我们心怀感恩、追光逐梦，</span></p><section><span>我们青春无敌、气象万千。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH7U4XfiaKVnF1Io2Sc2wd1siclVUej5iavnMsq0IAL0tHq9LRDCWDVALyw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>让每一个孩子都成才成长，</span></p><p><span>我们与学生双向奔赴，</span></p><p><span>一道涵养真诚、真心、真本领，</span></p><section><span>一道挑起强国建设、民族复兴的重担！</span></section><p><span>总书记对青年的深情嘱托，</span></p><p><span>如同航标指引航程。</span></p><p><span>我们要有理想、敢担当、能吃苦、肯奋斗，</span></p><p><span>永远听党话、跟党走，</span></p><section><span>不负韶华、不负期盼！</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHrwmmbNib7TPlibbBHUEvGRpfaRGE17ed6KhW9NI2OHaC5g3QicZQ72HEw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>为建成农业特色世界一流大学，</span></p><p><span>为形成农业新质生产力，</span></p><p><span>我们将谨记“问题就是时代的声音”，</span></p><p><span>自觉打破学科壁垒、“跨界”创新思维，</span></p><p><span>以新格局培育新人、探索未知，</span></p><section><span>以奋斗精神克难攻坚！</span></section><p><span>作为莘莘学子，</span></p><p><span>我们要严格自律、刻苦学习，</span></p><p><span>我们要增长本领、积蓄能量。</span></p><p><span>待到我们毕业时，</span></p><p><span>老师您会知道，</span></p><section><span>我们也可以成为你们！</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHcxaa0eibJQgibicmhjibEQSkBiau5PG19P2hk4zPOVl3zk3IzO2TXxV7gtg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>强国必先强农，</span></p><p><span>这个使命我们承担！</span></p><p><span>我们把论文写在大地上，</span></p><p><span>把成果留在百姓家。</span></p><p><span>我们在“万名学子乡村大调研”中当主力，</span></p><p><span>参加突击队让我们壮筋骨、长才干。</span></p><p><span>当好“新农人”，</span></p><section><span>服务“百千万”！</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH8ZIsW36M43jVNxE1L3iac95JUsc71lecRm6wiasnPDeib7VPO3JmUPofg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>新的征途在我们面前延展，</span></p><p><span>我们知道它不可能一马平川，</span></p><p><span>但我们心中有光、脚下有路，</span></p><p><span>我们每一个人都有力量，</span></p><p><span>我们的支援来自四面八方，</span></p><p><span>即使面对急流险滩，</span></p><p><span>即使面对惊涛骇浪，</span></p><p><span>我们将无所畏惧，</span></p><p><span>我们将奋力向前，</span></p><p><span>踏过长空万里，</span></p><p><span>跨过岁月山河，</span></p><section><span>到达梦想的彼岸。</span></section><p><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH98syRr7PhGQLUY2J1KukTxZ93wvYrn56iapHuSjI2FYdkuILgkBDnZQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></p><p><span>今天，我们向新出发，</span></p><p><span>今天，我们向新出发，</span></p><section><span>今天，我们向新出发！</span><em></em></section><section><section><section><p><strong>▶ 往期回顾</strong></p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652806698&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=6983f3f35539d1bd6b88dbc0f8ae82d2&amp;chksm=bcd59d358ba2142330136f2077c11839649125e8285575bff8c7446b933abbe892aa427030b8&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXH84pFticPj2GZVOcZfzTUW2RpLaVWqCgmPUKnx7E4uoEiabCIRicRZRp2A/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 青春永不散场！亲爱的华农校友，欢迎回家！</p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652806307&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=d6f7f17b2f4b0e84c6ca4c48b1e3c3b5&amp;chksm=bcd59fbc8ba216aaefc2edf841509ef1b5238f813f799f9cc4fc313e740966b9b79c4ecb0aea&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHFV99Sx5JhibjT0545CC7eAt8vKmKakvwFYn9TTfGicc2ygaBfWNGFNRw/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 华农办学115周年发展大会，圆满举行！</p></section></section><section><section><a href=\"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MjM5OTE2MzUwNA==&amp;mid=2652804540&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=fd0d97fb624fe071338326e78400d12b&amp;chksm=bcd596a38ba21fb5f337fb4420a48ef7a2b923b6230b22b159f1a602e417dbdbdf92c1e7d15a&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/w4bIWyNFlc8kZqP69kicz6WHdH1pRIoXHuqYTKjlURHFEQHPRFdc5FRguq9GrulPuPjibvZdcG20xicELHAWialDbw/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><p>▲ 今天，华南农业大学115岁了</p></section></section><section><p><span>图丨往期图库</span></p><p><span>初审 | 安沛</span></p><p><span>复审 | 陈芃辰</span></p><p><span>终审 | 钟耿涛</span></p></section><section><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_